<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Letting AI operate production Azure: what it gets wrong — Damian Flynn</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ── Viewport-safe base ─────────────────────────────── */
html, body { height: 100%; overflow-x: hidden; margin: 0; }
html { scroll-snap-type: y mandatory; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
.slide { width: 100vw; height: 100vh; height: 100dvh; overflow: hidden; scroll-snap-align: start;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; position: relative; box-sizing: border-box; }
.slide-content { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
  max-height: 100%; overflow: hidden; padding: var(--slide-padding); box-sizing: border-box; gap: var(--content-gap); }

/* ── Theme ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
:root {
  --bg: #111418; --bg-raise: #1b2027; --fg: #f2f4f7; --muted: #a8b1bd; --hairline: #2e3540;
  --accent: #ff8a3d; --ok: #5fd39a; --deny: #ff6b6b;
  --font-display: "Space Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-body: "Space Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-mono: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
  /* 4-step ramp, ratio ≈1.414 — body ≥24px, title ≥48px at 1280w+ */
  --title-size: clamp(3rem, 5.6vw, 6rem);
  --h2-size: clamp(2.25rem, 3.9vw, 4.25rem);
  --body-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.95vw, 2.125rem);
  --small-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.35vw, 1.5rem);
  --slide-padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 6rem);
  --content-gap: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 3rem);
  --element-gap: clamp(0.5rem, 1vw, 1rem);
}
body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--body-size); line-height: 1.45; }
h1, h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
h1 { font-size: var(--title-size); max-width: 20ch; }
h2 { font-size: var(--h2-size); max-width: 24ch; }
p { margin: 0; max-width: 46ch; }
.small { font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--muted); }
.mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); }
.accent { color: var(--accent); }
.kicker { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
.kicker .accent { color: var(--accent); }

/* Section marker */
.section-mark { position: absolute; top: var(--slide-padding); left: var(--slide-padding); }

/* Lists */
ul.clean { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(0.75rem, 1.5vh, 1.5rem); }
ul.clean li { max-width: 48ch; padding-left: 1.25em; position: relative; }
ul.clean li::before { content: "—"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--muted); }

/* Cards / grids */
.grid2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--content-gap); max-width: 1600px; }
.grid4 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); max-width: 1500px; }
.card { background: var(--bg-raise); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 8px; padding: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem);
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--element-gap); }
.card h3 { font-size: var(--body-size); margin: 0; font-weight: 700; }
.card p { font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--muted); max-width: none; }
.card.hl { border-color: var(--accent); }
.tag { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--muted); }

/* Flow diagrams */
.flow { display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: 0; max-width: 1600px; }
.node { background: var(--bg-raise); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 8px; padding: clamp(0.75rem, 1.5vw, 1.5rem);
  min-width: 0; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 0.25em; }
.node b { font-size: var(--body-size); }
.node span { font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--muted); }
.node.hl { border: 2px solid var(--accent); }
.arrow { flex: 0 0 auto; align-self: center; padding: 0 clamp(0.5rem, 1vw, 1rem); font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--muted); text-align: center; }
.arrow::after { content: "→"; display: block; font-size: var(--h2-size); line-height: 1; color: var(--fg); }

/* Log line */
.log { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--small-size); background: #0b0d10; border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); padding: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.5rem); border-radius: 4px; max-width: 1500px; line-height: 1.6; white-space: pre; overflow: hidden; }
.log .k { color: var(--muted); }

/* Status chips (never hue alone: always a code + word) */
.chip { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 600; padding: 0.1em 0.5em; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid currentColor; white-space: nowrap; }
.chip.ok { color: var(--ok); } .chip.deny { color: var(--deny); }
.beats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; gap: clamp(0.75rem, 1.6vh, 1.5rem) clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); align-items: baseline; max-width: 1400px; }
.beats .n { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--small-size); }

/* Statement slides */
.statement h1, .statement h2 { max-width: 18ch; }
.statement .sub { margin-top: var(--content-gap); color: var(--muted); }

/* Layers */
.layers { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(0.75rem, 1.5vh, 1.25rem); max-width: 1400px; }
.layer { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3ch 16ch 1fr; gap: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); align-items: baseline;
  background: var(--bg-raise); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 8px; padding: clamp(0.75rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem) clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); }
.layer .num { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--small-size); }
.layer b { font-size: var(--body-size); }
.layer span { font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--muted); }
.layer.hl { border-color: var(--accent); }

/* Speaker slide */
.speaker { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 5rem); align-items: center; max-width: 1600px; }
.speaker img.head { width: clamp(180px, 20vw, 340px); height: auto; max-height: none; border-radius: 50%; border: 3px solid var(--hairline); }
.speaker .who p { max-width: none; }
.speaker .who { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--element-gap); }
.speaker img.mvp { width: clamp(200px, 18vw, 320px); max-height: none; margin-top: var(--element-gap); }
.links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5em 2em; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--muted); margin-top: var(--element-gap); }

/* Demo */
.demo-badge { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--bg); background: var(--accent); padding: 0.2em 0.6em; border-radius: 4px; align-self: flex-start; }


/* Illustration backgrounds (art fills the right; text sits on the dark left) */
.art { position: absolute; inset: 0; background-size: cover; background-position: right center; z-index: 0; }
.art::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--bg) 0%, var(--bg) 28%, rgba(17,20,24,0.55) 52%, rgba(17,20,24,0) 72%); }
.art.low::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--bg) 0%, rgba(17,20,24,0.7) 45%, rgba(17,20,24,0.25) 75%), linear-gradient(0deg, var(--bg) 0%, rgba(17,20,24,0) 55%); }
.slide > .slide-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.art-slide h1, .art-slide h2 { max-width: 17ch; }
.art-slide p { max-width: 40ch; }
.art-slide ul.clean li { max-width: 30ch; }


/* Screenshot slide */
.shot { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 5rem); align-items: center; max-width: 1700px; }
.shot img { width: 100%; max-height: min(62vh, 640px); object-fit: contain; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--hairline); box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); background: #fff; }
.shot .txt { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--content-gap); }


/* Talk 2: chapter cards + checklist */
.chap h1 { max-width: 13ch; }
.stakes { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--h2-size); color: var(--accent); line-height: 1.15; max-width: 22ch; }
.go-terminal { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--muted); }
.steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); max-width: 1600px; }
.six { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); max-width: 1600px; }
.rules { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(0.5rem, 1.2vh, 1rem); max-width: 1500px; }
.rule { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3ch 1fr; gap: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); align-items: baseline; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); padding-bottom: clamp(0.4rem, 1vh, 0.8rem); }
.rule .num { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--accent); font-size: var(--small-size); }
.rule b { font-size: var(--body-size); }
.q { font-size: var(--body-size); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); padding-left: 1.25rem; max-width: 52ch; }


/* Harness table */
table.h { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 1600px; font-size: var(--small-size); }
table.h th { text-align: left; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); padding: 0 1.25rem 0.6rem 0; }
table.h td { padding: clamp(0.4rem, 1vh, 0.75rem) 1.25rem clamp(0.4rem, 1vh, 0.75rem) 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); vertical-align: baseline; }
table.h td:first-child { font-weight: 700; color: var(--fg); font-size: var(--body-size); white-space: nowrap; }
table.h td.m { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--fg); }
table.h td.k { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--accent); }


.grid3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); max-width: 1600px; }
.card .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--fg); }


/* Scene diagrams */
.scene { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(0.75rem, 1.8vh, 1.5rem); max-width: 1700px; width: 100%; }
.scene .flow { max-width: none; }
.scene .node { min-height: 0; }
.node.bad { border: 2px dashed var(--deny); }
.node.good { border: 2px solid var(--ok); }
.node .flag { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--small-size); font-weight: 600; }
.node.bad .flag { color: var(--deny); } .node.good .flag { color: var(--ok); }
.node.ghost { background: transparent; border-style: dashed; }
.sandbox { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--muted); border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); padding-top: clamp(0.5rem, 1.2vh, 1rem); max-width: 1700px; }
.sandbox b { color: var(--fg); font-weight: 600; }
.scn h2 { max-width: 36ch; }
@media (max-height: 760px) { .scn .node { padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem; } .scn .slide-content { gap: 1rem; } }
.lane { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--small-size); color: var(--muted); }

/* Chrome: progress + index */
.progress { position: fixed; left: 0; bottom: 0; height: 4px; background: var(--accent); width: 0; transition: width 0.3s ease; z-index: 10; }
.index { position: fixed; right: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); bottom: clamp(0.75rem, 1.5vw, 1.5rem); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 1rem; color: var(--muted); z-index: 10; }
.footer-id { position: fixed; left: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem); bottom: clamp(0.75rem, 1.5vw, 1.5rem); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 1rem; color: var(--muted); z-index: 10; }

/* Speaker notes (press N) */
aside.notes { display: none; }
body.show-notes aside.notes { display: block; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; max-height: 34vh; overflow: auto;
  background: rgba(10,12,15,0.96); border-top: 2px solid var(--accent); padding: 1rem 2rem 2.5rem; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--fg); line-height: 1.5; z-index: 20; }
body.show-notes aside.notes::before { content: "SPEAKER NOTES · N to hide"; display: block; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

/* Reveal */
.reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease; }
.slide.visible .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
.slide.visible .reveal.d1 { transition-delay: 0.1s; } .slide.visible .reveal.d2 { transition-delay: 0.2s; }
.slide.visible .reveal.d3 { transition-delay: 0.3s; } .slide.visible .reveal.d4 { transition-delay: 0.4s; }

.hidden-backup { /* still navigable, labelled */ }

@media (max-height: 700px) { :root { --title-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem); --h2-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.2vw, 2.75rem);
  --body-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem); --small-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.1vw, 1.125rem); --slide-padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); } }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .grid2, .grid4, .speaker { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .flow { flex-direction: column; } .arrow::after { content: "↓"; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { *, *::before, *::after { animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; transition-duration: 0.2s !important; }
  html { scroll-behavior: auto; } .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main id="deck">
<section class="slide statement" data-title="Cold open">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <h1 class="reveal">An AI agent recommended the same fix <span class="accent">four times</span>.</h1>
    <p class="sub reveal d2">Confident. Well-reasoned. Impossible.</p>
  </div>
  
</section>

<section class="slide art-slide" data-title="Title">
  <div class="art " style="background-image:url('data:image/jpeg;base64,')"></div>
  <div class="slide-content">
    <div class="kicker reveal">Lab · Microsoft Dublin · 10 Nov 2026 · 90 min show and tell</div>
    <h1 class="reveal d1">Letting AI operate production Azure: <span class="accent">what it gets wrong</span></h1>
    <p class="small reveal d2">Damian Flynn · Microsoft MVP, Azure · Innofactor</p>
  </div>
  
</section>

<section class="slide" data-title="Who am I">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <div class="speaker">
      <img class="head reveal" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Damian Flynn">
      <div class="who">
        <h2 class="reveal d1">Damian Flynn</h2>
        <p class="reveal d2">Practice Lead &amp; Principal Consultant (Azure), <b>Innofactor</b></p>
        <p class="small reveal d2">30+ years in enterprise IT · cloud since 2009 · Mayo, Ireland<br>Azure Infrastructure as Code · Azure Networking · 17 years an MVP</p>
        <img class="mvp reveal d3" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Microsoft Most Valuable Professional">
        <div class="links reveal d4"><span>damianflynn.com</span><span>github.com/damianflynn</span><span>linkedin.com/in/damianflynn</span><span>mvp.microsoft.com</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
</section>

<section class="slide statement" data-title="Thesis">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <h1 class="reveal">AI doesn't fail loudly.</h1>
    <h2 class="reveal d2 accent">It fails plausibly.</h2>
  </div>
  
</section>

<section class="slide" data-title="How this works">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <h2 class="reveal">Six incidents. Same steps each time.</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="card reveal d1"><span class="tag">1</span><h3>The story</h3><p>What happened in production. Customers anonymised.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal d2"><span class="tag">2</span><h3>The trap</h3><p>The agent's mistake, replayed from a real session.</p></div>
      <div class="card hl reveal d3"><span class="tag">3</span><h3>The guardrail</h3><p>A real check, run live, catching it.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal d4"><span class="tag">4</span><h3>The rule</h3><p>One line you can take home.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
</section>

<section class="slide" data-title="Where guardrails live">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <h2 class="reveal">You launch Claude and fire away. <span class="accent">Where does the guardrail fire?</span></h2>
    <div class="layers">
      <div class="layer reveal d1"><span class="num">A</span><b>Instructions</b><span>CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md. Advice. The model reads it and can still skip it.</span></div>
      <div class="layer hl reveal d2"><span class="num">B</span><b>Hooks</b><span>.claude/settings.json. Claude Code runs them on every tool call, not the model. Exit 2 blocks the call and tells the model why.</span></div>
      <div class="layer reveal d3"><span class="num">C</span><b>Platform</b><span>Branch protection, disabled pipelines, PR checks. Holds even when the agent isn't Claude.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
</section>

<section class="slide" data-title="Every harness">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <h2 class="reveal">Not a Claude trick. <span class="accent">Every harness has a Layer B.</span></h2>
    <table class="h reveal d1">
      <tr><th>Harness</th><th>Where it lives</th><th>Event</th><th>How it blocks</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Claude Code</td><td class="m">.claude/settings.json</td><td class="m">PreToolUse</td><td class="k">exit 2</td></tr>
      <tr><td>GitHub Copilot CLI</td><td class="m">.github/hooks/*.json</td><td class="m">preToolUse</td><td class="k">"permissionDecision": "deny"</td></tr>
      <tr><td>OpenAI Codex</td><td class="m">.codex/hooks.json</td><td class="m">PreToolUse</td><td class="k">deny</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Gemini CLI</td><td class="m">.gemini/settings.json</td><td class="m">BeforeTool</td><td class="k">exit 2</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Pi</td><td class="m">.pi/extensions/*.ts</td><td class="m">pi.on("tool_call")</td><td class="k">{ block: true }</td></tr>
      <tr><td>OpenCode</td><td class="m">.opencode/plugins/*.ts</td><td class="m">tool.execute.before</td><td class="k">throw</td></tr>
    </table>
    <p class="small reveal d2">Same guardrail script, six doors. Seen blocking live this week: 5 of 6. <span class="accent">Untrusted folder? The hook silently doesn't fire.</span></p>
  </div>
  
</section>

<section class="slide" data-title="The six">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <h2 class="reveal">The six</h2>
    <div class="six">
      <div class="card reveal d1"><span class="tag">1</span><h3>Empty is not unset</h3></div>
      <div class="card reveal d1"><span class="tag">2</span><h3>Green is not working</h3></div>
      <div class="card reveal d2"><span class="tag">3</span><h3>The world moved while I was thinking</h3></div>
      <div class="card reveal d2"><span class="tag">4</span><h3>Telephone</h3></div>
      <div class="card reveal d3"><span class="tag">5</span><h3>Who reviews the reviewer?</h3></div>
      <div class="card hl reveal d3"><span class="tag">6</span><h3>A freeze is a promise, not a lock</h3></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
</section>
<section class="slide art-slide chap" data-title="1 · Empty is not unset">
  <div class="art " style="background-image:url('data:image/jpeg;base64,')"></div>
  <div class="slide-content">
    <div class="kicker reveal">Incident <span class="accent">1</span> / 6</div>
    <h1 class="reveal d1">Empty is not unset</h1>
    <div class="stakes reveal d2">Recommended 4×.<br>Settable: never.</div>
    <div class="go-terminal reveal d3">Lives in: hook · PreToolUse on writes &nbsp;·&nbsp; → ./present.sh 1</div>
  </div>
  
</section>

<section class="slide scn" data-title="1 · scene">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <div class="kicker reveal">Incident <span class="accent">1</span> · the scene</div>
    <h2 class="reveal d1">Where the agent looked, and where the setting really lives</h2>
    <div class="scene reveal d2">
      <div class="flow"><div class="node good"><b>Staff laptops</b><span>Azure VPN Client, Entra sign-in</span><span class="flag">✓ the real fix: client profile</span></div><div class="arrow">P2S<br>OpenVPN</div><div class="node bad"><b>VPN gateway</b><span>vpnClientConfiguration</span><span class="flag">✗ vpnClientDnsServers: not a member</span></div><div class="arrow"></div><div class="node "><b>Hub network</b><span>internal DNS resolvers</span></div></div>
      <div class="lane">The agent read the gateway, got <b>(empty)</b>, and recommended setting it. Four times.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="sandbox reveal d3"><b>In the sandbox:</b> a VNet takes the same read/write test (one real member, one invented), and the published API spec is checked for the gateway's members.</div>
  </div>
  
</section>

<section class="slide art-slide chap" data-title="2 · Green is not working">
  <div class="art " style="background-image:url('data:image/jpeg;base64,')"></div>
  <div class="slide-content">
    <div class="kicker reveal">Incident <span class="accent">2</span> / 6</div>
    <h1 class="reveal d1">Green is not working</h1>
    <div class="stakes reveal d2">Sev 1 alert fired.<br>Receivers: 0.</div>
    <div class="go-terminal reveal d3">Lives in: hook · PostToolUse + a scheduled check &nbsp;·&nbsp; → ./present.sh 2</div>
  </div>
  
</section>

<section class="slide scn" data-title="2 · scene">
  <div class="slide-content">
    <div class="kicker reveal">Incident <span class="accent">2</span> · the scene</div>
    <h2 class="reveal d1">Three green lights, three dead systems</h2>
    <div class="scene reveal d2">
      <div class="flow"><div class="node bad"><b>Bootstrap</b><span>0 changed · 0 failed</span><span class="flag">✗ no gate could run</span></div><div class="arrow">presence<br>≠ capability</div><div class="node bad"><b>Import loop</b><span>failed 0</span><span class="flag">✗ registry holds 1 of 6</span></div><div class="arrow"></div><div class="node bad"><b>VM data disk</b><span>/healthz → 200</span><span class="flag">✗ mount dead 2h16m</span></div></div>
      <div class="flow"><div class="node good"><b>Sev 1 alert</b><span>fired</span><span class="flag">✓ detection worked</span></div><div class="arrow">notify</div><div class="node bad"><b>Action group</b><span>receivers: 0</span><span class="flag">✗ nobody told</span></div><div class="arrow"></div><div class="node ghost"><b>On-call</b><span>—</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sandbox reveal d3"><b>In the sandbox:</b> a fixture import loop that prints failed 0, and a real alert rule pointing at a real action group with zero receivers.</div>
  </div>
  
</section>

